 12 | - `<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/02_spatiotemporal_metrics/migration_summary_64_to_71.json`
 13 | - `<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/02_spatiotemporal_metrics/migration_summary_post71.json`
